{
  "an4.111:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 4.111 ",
  "an4.111:0.2": "12. Kesivagga ",
  "an4.111:0.3": "Kesisutta ",
  "an4.111:1.1": "Atha kho kesi assadammasārathi yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinnaṁ kho kesiṁ assadammasārathiṁ bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "an4.111:1.2": "“tvaṁ khosi, kesi, paññāto assadammasārathīti. ",
  "an4.111:1.3": "Kathaṁ pana tvaṁ, kesi, assadammaṁ vinesī”ti? ",
  "an4.111:1.4": "“Ahaṁ kho, bhante, assadammaṁ saṇhenapi vinemi, pharusenapi vinemi, saṇhapharusenapi vinemī”ti. ",
  "an4.111:1.5": "“Sace te, kesi, assadammo saṇhena vinayaṁ na upeti, pharusena vinayaṁ na upeti, saṇhapharusena vinayaṁ na upeti, kinti naṁ karosī”ti? ",
  "an4.111:1.6": "“Sace me, bhante, assadammo saṇhena vinayaṁ na upeti, pharusena vinayaṁ na upeti, saṇhapharusena vinayaṁ na upeti; ",
  "an4.111:1.7": "hanāmi naṁ, bhante. ",
  "an4.111:1.8": "Taṁ kissa hetu? ",
  "an4.111:1.9": "‘Mā me ācariyakulassa avaṇṇo ahosī’ti. ",
  "an4.111:2.1": "Bhagavā pana, bhante, anuttaro purisadammasārathi. ",
  "an4.111:2.2": "Kathaṁ pana, bhante, bhagavā purisadammaṁ vinetī”ti? ",
  "an4.111:2.3": "“Ahaṁ kho, kesi, purisadammaṁ saṇhenapi vinemi, pharusenapi vinemi, saṇhapharusenapi vinemi. ",
  "an4.111:2.4": "Tatridaṁ, kesi, saṇhasmiṁ—",
  "an4.111:2.5": "iti kāyasucaritaṁ iti kāyasucaritassa vipāko, iti vacīsucaritaṁ iti vacīsuca